flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Use a stolen boat to infiltrate the fabrication plant and prepare for the convoy heist."])
 _A1_(["Hijacker, Engineer and Bomber drift into the docks like they belong there."])
 _A1_1_(["Moored ahead, the research vessel bustles with activity as her crew prepares for departure."])
 _A1_2_(["After a quick scan of the boat, Hijacker confirms there are only three people on board."])
 _A1_C1_{"Hijacker leads the charge to commandeer the ship."}
 _A1_C1P_["Hijacker storms the bridge, drops the captain with a punch, and takes the helm."]
 _A2_(["Engineer and Bomber block the gangway and threaten the crew to back down."])
 _A2_1_(["The captain and her crew are taken to the ship&#39;s bow, their hands bound behind their backs."])
 _A2_C1_{"With the crew subdued, Hijacker tries to discreetly sail the ship out of the harbor."}
 _A2_C1P_["The vessel clears the port and glides smoothly into the bay."]
 _A2_5_(["As the ship passes over deep water, the hostages are thrown overboard."])
 _A3_(["Hijacker cuts the engines when the fabrication facility comes into view."])
 _A3_1_(["Engineer and Bomber head below deck and strap themselves into the submersible."])
 _A3_2_(["With the breathing apparatus in place, the engine starts and they launch smoothly into the sea."])
 _A3_3_(["Cruising silently beneath the waves, they ease to a stop by the facility&#39;s outflow pipe."])
 _A3_C1_{"Engineer approaches the grate and clamps a thermite charge onto its outer frame."}
 _A3_C1P_["The charge burns steadily, weakening the grate and allowing it to fall clear."]
 _A4_(["Inching forward, the SDV is maneuvered through the flooded pipe."])
 _A4_1_(["Emerging beneath the plant, the team disembarks and tethers the SDV to the maintenance platform."])
 _A4_3_(["As expected, the outflow pipe&#39;s access hatch can only be opened from above."])
 _A4_4_(["Pickpocket and Imitator arrive on scene, pulling into the fabrication plant&#39;s parking lot."])
 _A4_5_(["As they approach the goods entrance, the guard demands to see some identification."])
 _A4_C1_{"Imitator tries to charm his way in, posing as a safety inspector."}
 _A4_C1P_["Imitator&#39;s assuredness convinces the guard to let them through."]
 _A5_(["Heads down, the pair try to blend in as they make their way through the facility."])
 _A5_1_(["On the lookout for a security radio, Pickpocket spots a guard heading to the bathroom."])
 _A5_2_(["Imitator rushes over to intercept her, pretending to be a concerned employee."])
 _A5_C1_{"Pickpocket tries to lift the guard&#39;s radio as Imitator distracts her."}
 _A5_C1F_["The guard catches Pickpocket trailing her, forcing her to back off."]
 _A5_C2_{"Imitator attempts to create a distraction while Pickpocket tries again."}
 _A5_C2P_["Engaged in conversation, the guard is oblivious as Pickpocket steals her radio."]
 _A6_(["The pair heads to the stairwell and Pickpocket hands the radio to Imitator."])
 _A6_1_(["Imitator reports an intruder in the parking lot, drawing most of the security team outside."])
 _A6_2_(["With the utility level clear, they head downstairs to the pump room."])
 _A6_3_(["Imitator keeps watch while Pickpocket turns the handwheel to open the hatch."])
 _A6_4_(["Engineer and Bomber emerge from the pipe, confirming the SDV is in place."])
 _A6_5_(["The team moves to the service tunnel to execute the next step of the plan."])
 _A6_6_(["As his teammates stand guard, Bomber prepares the plastic explosives."])
 _A6_C1_{"Bomber looks for a discreet place to hide the C4 in the tunnel beneath the road."}
 _A6_C1P_["Bomber hides the bomb inside a hollow section of cable trunking."]
 _A7_(["Pickpocket is invited to try and locate the bomb, but she cannot."])
 _A7_1_(["Satisfied with the placement, the crew heads upstairs to make one final observation."])
 _A7_2_(["Pickpocket and Bomber return to the car while the others approach the crane."])
 _A7_3_(["As they near the ladder, a yard tech calls out, demanding to know who they are."])
 _A7_C1_{"Posing as a city safety inspector, Imitator insists on being given access to the crane."}
 _A7_C1P_["The yard tech grants them permission to access the crane&#39;s cabin."]
 _A8_(["Imitator and Engineer scale the ladder, reaching the operator&#39;s cabin."])
 _A8_1_(["Engineer directs Imitator to take photos of the passing convoy with the camera."])
 _A8_2_(["The choke point is documented, as is a potential sniper&#39;s nest."])
 _A8_3_(["Having taken all the images they need, the duo descends the ladder to leave."])
 _A8S_(["The crew leaves the fabrication plant, their grand nuclear heist now primed for detonation."])
 _A4_C1F_["The guard notices Imitator&#39;s nervous tone and makes him wait while he calls someone."]
 _A4_6_(["Scared of being rumbled, they head off to find an alternative way in."])
 _A4_7_(["Imitator finds a side entrance that requires a keycard to unlock."])
 _A4_C2_{"Spotting a group of idling workers, Pickpocket tries to swipe one of their keycards."}
 _A4_C2F_["Pickpocket is caught in the act and surrounded, with one worker brandishing a wrench."]
 _A4_C3_{"Imitator walks over and tries to defuse the situation."}
 _A4_C3F_["Imitator&#39;s attempt fails, the workers unconvinced by his bullshit."]
 _A4_8_(["Instead of calling the cops, the workers have some fun, beating the pair half to death."])
 _A4F_(["After a long wait, the dive crew realizes something has gone awry, so they strap in and depart."])
 _A1_C1F_["Hijacker rushes aboard, but the captain resists and slams her to the deck."]
 _A1_C2_{"Seeing Hijacker in trouble, Bomber brandishes the C4 as a warning."}
 _A1_C2P_["The threat of being blown to smithereens forces the crew to stand down."]
 _A2_2_(["The captain releases Hijacker, allowing her to take the helm."])
 _A2_4_(["The captain and her crew are taken to the ship&#39;s bow, their hands bound behind their backs."])
 _A5_C1P_["Imitator makes small talk as Pickpocket slides the radio from its holster."]
 _A6_C1F_["Bomber botches the bomb placement, with the wiring clearly visible."]
 _A6_7_(["When Pickpocket is asked to find the bomb, she spots it almost instantly."])
 _A6_C2_{"Bomber tries to conceal the bomb in a less obvious place."}
 _A6_C2P_["The bomb is neatly placed in the cavity behind a junction box."]
 _A2_C1F_["Hijacker&#39;s poor handling scrapes the ship against the dock, drawing attention."]
 _A2_C2_{"Engineer rushes to the bridge to help Hijacker regain control."}
 _A2_C2F_["A hard turn drives the stern into the dock, wrecking the ship&#39;s propeller."]
 _A2F_(["Dead in the water, the vessel is boarded and the team is arrested by port security."])
 _A1_C2F_["The captain dismisses the threat and keeps Hijacker pinned, refusing to back down."]
 _A1_C3_{"Hijacker tries to wrestle free as the others storm the ship to help."}
 _A1_C3P_["While she&#39;s distracted, Hijacker slams a punch into the captain’s gut, taking her down hard."]
 _A2_3_(["With the captain subdued, the team finally gains the upper hand and commandeers the vessel."])
 _A2_C2P_["With Engineer&#39;s help, the ship&#39;s course is corrected and they sail into the bay."]
 _A3_C1F_["Right before ignition, Bomber intervenes, having noticed the charge has come loose."]
 _A3_C2_{"Bomber helps Engineer reseat the charge to ensure the grate is cut cleanly."}
 _A3_C2P_["The thermite burns through the metal with ease, and Engineer pulls the grate away."]
 _A4_C2P_["Pickpocket makes some chit-chat and casually lifts an entry card."]
 _A4_9_(["Pickpocket returns to Imitator and they slip inside the fabrication facility."])
 _A7_C1F_["The yard tech refuses to budge and presses Imitator for more details."]
 _A7_C2_{"Engineer uses his technical know-how to persuade the yard tech."}
 _A7_C2P_["The tech buys Engineer&#39;s story but still won&#39;t allow him to access the crane."]
 _A8_4_(["After some negotiation, he reluctantly permits the team to inspect the area from the ground."])
 _A8_5_(["Imitator starts photographing parts of the facility to plan their heist."])
 _A8_6_(["Viewing the road, Engineer identifies the best place to intercept the truck."])
 _A8S2_(["With the layout locked in, the crew leaves, ready to ignite their volatile scheme."])
 _A7_C2F_["The tech frowns as Engineer contradicts his own story multiple times."]
 _A8_7_(["When the tech radios his supervisor, the team decides to bolt."])
 _A8_8_(["Imitator pulls out his camera and takes a few quick shots of the crane."])
 _A8_9_(["When the tech complains, Engineer shoves him away as the pair rushes to escape."])
 _A8S3_(["The team departs the plant armed with enough intel to ensure an explosive finale to their plan."])
 _A4_C3P_["Identifying as a security officer, Imitator convinces the workers this was a test."]
 _A4_10_(["With tensions eased, Imitator tricks the workers into letting them inside."])
 _A5_C2F_["Imitator fails to keep the guard&#39;s attention and she spots Pickpocket coming."]
 _A5_3_(["Pickpocket shoves her away and a three-way brawl kicks off."])
 _A5_4_(["Several workers are drawn in by the fracas, with Imitator taking a kick to the head."])
 _A5F_(["The duo is beaten bloody as the others give up and exit the facility."])
 _A3_C2F_["The burn falters midway, leaving a large portion of the grate intact."]
 _A3_C3_{"With no other choice, Engineer rams the SDV through the remains of the barrier."}
 _A3_C3P_["The grate buckles from the impact, the SDV passing through with a crunch."]
 _A6_C2F_["Yet again, Pickpocket uncovers the bomb in no time, pissing Bomber off."]
 _A6_C3_{"Pickpocket uses his blade to help Bomber shape the C4."}
 _A6_C3P_["The plastic explosives are carved and forced into a nook in the support column."]
 _A6_C3F_["A slip of the hand causes Pickpocket to cut through a wire, detonating the C4."]
 _A6F_(["Hearing the blast, Imitator makes a swift exit, leaving his maimed teammates behind."])
 _A3_C3F_["The SDV’s nose crumples on impact, the grate holding firm against the blow."]
 _A3F_(["With the sub damaged and pipe inaccessible, the team concedes defeat and returns to the ship."])
 _A1_C3F_["Unknown"]

